# Products (1,666 URLs) → /shop/ browse holding page.
# P0-1 FIX: /shop/ is a REAL built static page (out/shop/index.html). The serve-guard
# (status 200, rewrite-in-place) MUST come BEFORE the /shop/* splat, otherwise the splat
# matches /shop/ itself and 301s it to /shop/ → infinite loop (the prior bug). Targets are
# /shop/ WITH trailing slash to match trailingSlash:true and land in a single hop.
/shop/   /shop/   200
/shop/*  /shop/   301

# /brands/* (57 URLs) → size-chart hub (relevant: brand archive → brand size charts)
